ty,30,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2,0,8,10,10,80,1Style: OP13-Karaoke,Duality,60,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,8,10,10,10,1Style: OP13-Translation,Duality,60,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,2,10,10,10,1Style: OP13-Kanji,Duality,60,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,8,10,10,110,1Style: OP13-Credits,FOT-Greco Std B,40,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,95,100,1,0,1,2.2,0,1,80,10,100,1Style: Map,Roboto,39,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2,2,2,10,10,10,1Style: Lyrics Post-War,FOT-Greco Std B,39,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2.6,0,2,10,10,15,1Style: Main-480p,Impress BT,37,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,1.5,1.5,2,80,80,12,1Style: Secondary-480p,Impress BT,37,&H00D6D6D6,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,1.5,1.5,2,80,80,12,1Style: Thoughts-480p,Impress BT,37,&H00FFFFFF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00525252,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,1.75,1.5,2,80,80,12,1Style: Captions-480p,Roboto,26,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,1.5,0,2,7,7,7,1Style: Note-480p,Impress BT,25,&H00FFFFFF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,&H96000000,0,-1,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,1.5,1.5,8,80,80,12,1Style: Title-480p,Agency FB,42,&H00FEFEFE,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,-1,0,0,0,120,100,0.333333,0,1,1.33333,0,2,7,7,7,1Style: Credits-480p,FOT-Greco Std B,19,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,95,100,0.666667,0,1,2.2,0,7,7,7,7,1Style: Flashbacks-480p,Impress BT,37,&H00FFFFFF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00525252,&H78000000,0,-1,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,1.16667,1,2,80,80,12,1Style: Main-207+,Impress BT,55,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2.5,2.5,2,120,120,18,1Style: Thoughts-207+,Impress BT,55,&H00FFFFFF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00525252,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2.75,2.5,2,120,120,18,1[Events]Format: Layer, Start, End, Style, Name, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, Effect, Text﻿[Script Info]; Script generated by Aegisub 3.2.2; http://www.aegisub.org/Title: Default Aegisub fileScriptType: v4.00+WrapStyle: 0ScaledBorderAndShadow: yesYCbCr Matrix: TV.601PlayResX: 1280PlayResY: 720Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.00,0:01:52.90,Title,,0,0,250,,The HunterDialogue: 1,0:01:50.00,0:01:52.90,Title,,0,0,250,,The HunterDialogue: 0,0:01:53.90,0:01:55.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's the mirage from earlier.Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.68,0:01:57.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In the end, you've only got one body.Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.72,0:02:00.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right. One of them is the real me.Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.25,0:02:05.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The other four are illusions formed from reflections in the frigid air. Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.25,0:02:08.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Illusions, you say?Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.23,0:02:11.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That sounds mysterious and lovely.Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.25,0:02:13.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But when you think about it rationally,Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.25,0:02:17.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,illusions obviously don't have offensive power.Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.24,0:02:21.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In other words, this is just an empty threat.Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.03,0:02:22.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right.Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.02,0:02:26.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So you turn defiant? You're not sweet, at all.Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.33,0:02:27.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thunder Charge!Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.25,0:02:32.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Only one of these five is real.Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.27,0:02:34.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So what?Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.27,0:02:35.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And...Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.76,0:02:37.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thunder Ball!Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.17,0:02:42.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Only 20% of my attacks are real as well. Why don't you try dodging them?Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.28,0:02:46.51,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, shoot! I have to defend myself! Which ones are real?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.27,0:02:51.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Their power, on the other hand, is 100%.Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.66,0:03:06.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is very different from the old Clima-Tact.Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.48,0:03:09.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A mere Thunder Ball attack has this much power.Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.41,0:03:12.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,With my next powerful attack, you're done.Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.48,0:03:17.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What kind of prediction is that? How cocky!Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.84,0:03:20.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not a prediction. It's a forecast.Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.51,0:03:22.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I control both the humidity and temperature.Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.90,0:03:25.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The weather in this room belongs to me!Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.51,0:03:29.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's the big deal with controlling the weather?Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.23,0:03:31.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Six Powers are techniques that exceed human abilities.Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.98,0:03:33.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How insolent!Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.14,0:03:35.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That wasn't the real one!Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.40,0:03:39.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Today, the chance of finding the real me is still 20%.Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.81,0:03:50.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,While atmospheric pressure is stable, today's skies show signs...Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.68,0:03:54.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,of a stationary front of small, dark clouds and violent winds.Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.46,0:03:58.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Given time, a clap of thunder should signal the lightning that will pierce your chest.Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.55,0:04:02.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beware of cardiac arrest!Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.26,0:04:04.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dark Cloud Tempo!Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.43,0:04:08.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If this is lightning, I showed you earlier that I can guard myself.Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.24,0:04:09.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As long as I'm being careful...Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.64,0:04:14.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The flaw in that technique is that you can't move around while using it.Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.45,0:04:23.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You sure take me lightly. Are you telling me to break it with an attack?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.42,0:04:24.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then...Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.54,0:04:26.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Soap Sheep!Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.00,0:04:29.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't have to know which one is the real one.Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.35,0:04:33.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll swallow everything with a big wave of Relaxing Bubbles.Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.25,0:04:36.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sheep Cloud!Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.55,0:04:40.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tidal Wave!Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.22,0:04:48.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll be a goner if I get hit by that.Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.26,0:04:51.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The one on the floor after I swallow everything is the real one.Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.18,0:04:53.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's not gonna happen!Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.68,0:04:55.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cyclone Tempo!Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.34,0:04:59.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She used wind to blow the bubbles away!Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.56,0:05:10.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But it looks like the one who got through it is the real one, huh?Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.30,0:05:23.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Finger Pistol!Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.17,0:05:28.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh? I thought it was another illusion.Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.17,0:05:32.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I won't let you get away again.Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.15,0:05:35.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll just riddle your body with holes.Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.18,0:05:42.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've already forgotten it, haven't you?Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.07,0:05:47.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You should pay attention to a navigator's weather forecast. Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.56,0:05:55.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A thunderbolt will surge out...Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.17,0:05:56.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,from the dark clouds to the Clima-Tact!Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.01,0:06:04.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on!Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.80,0:06:10.15,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,The clouds from earlier!Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.21,0:06:17.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thunder Lance Tempo!Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.38,0:06:24.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No matter how strong you are,Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.23,0:06:26.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,my forecasts are never wrong.Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.19,0:06:48.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My friends are waiting. I'll be taking your key.Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.76,0:06:58.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Deer-gorilla! Where'd you go?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.54,0:07:01.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What? Franky! What are you doing there?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.76,0:07:02.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, lady.Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.65,0:07:07.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That monster deer-gorilla in your group came here, didn't he?Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.77,0:07:09.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Deer... You mean Chopper?Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.98,0:07:11.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that deer-gorilla.Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.99,0:07:16.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he did. What's the deal? What happened to him?Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.29,0:07:18.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How should I know?! That was my question!Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.22,0:07:21.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Isn't he someone who can transform like that?Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.96,0:07:25.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How would I know?! I've never seen him in that form.Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.17,0:07:30.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see. I thought you guys might know how to deal with that.Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.01,0:07:32.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then, I guess I'll just kill him.Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.76,0:07:38.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you say that again, I'm gonna kill you.Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.44,0:07:41.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I-I'll never say it again. Ever again.Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.23,0:07:47.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,By the way, you're not bad yourself. You took this woman down?Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.56,0:07:50.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Her key is important: the No. 2 key.Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.90,0:07:54.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The key! Hold on a sec. I was just looking for it.Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.76,0:07:57.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Key! Key! Where'd you hide it?Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.78,0:08:00.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yow! Nice scandalous behavior!Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.94,0:08:03.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this monster?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.76,0:08:07.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Was there someone else with a zoan-type ability?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.62,0:08:09.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Does that mean that this guy's also part of CP9?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.97,0:08:13.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, I feel like I've seen him before.Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.30,0:08:16.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ch-Chopper?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.30,0:08:23.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What're you doing, Chopper?! It's us!Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.69,0:08:25.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ahh! Stop it!Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.77,0:08:31.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, is that really Chopper?! How come he doesn't recognize us?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.42,0:08:36.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but it must be Chopper! Who else has those antlers and wears that hat?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.42,0:08:39.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, where's our only chance? Where's the No. 2 key?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.51,0:08:42.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who knows? This is it! We're gonna die.Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.65,0:08:45.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But something is wrong.Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.10,0:08:49.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Isn't he the one who looks like he is about to die?Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.84,0:08:52.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It seems as if his life force is rapidly fading.Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.86,0:08:55.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wh-Wh-What does that mean?Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.85,0:09:00.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It may be that him staying in that form uses up too much energy or something.Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.43,0:09:04.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell?! What do we do about him and the other two?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.07,0:09:07.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, what happened to the key? Where's the No. 2 key?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.61,0:09:09.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know what happened,Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.89,0:09:13.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but he must've fought incredibly hard...Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.63,0:09:16.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So hard that he transformed into that.Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.91,0:09:18.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No. 2...Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.70,0:09:26.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's quite the interruption. What's that monster?Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.75,0:09:29.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The buster call is imminent.Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.09,0:09:32.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course he'd interrupt us. It seems like he's one of those pirates.Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.63,0:09:35.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anything that gets in our way...Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.07,0:09:36.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Should be eliminated.Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.84,0:09:41.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Although he's insignificant...Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.08,0:09:43.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've got more prey.Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.85,0:09:46.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit! They're gonna attack Chopper!Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.51,0:09:49.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straighten your back, named blade Nose Storm.Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.08,0:09:51.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,H-Hey! What're you gonna do?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.77,0:09:54.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,36-Pound Phoenix!Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.90,0:09:58.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You bastard!Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.85,0:10:00.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Step aside, you guys!Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.19,0:10:02.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Huh? – That guy...!Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.28,0:10:04.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky! What're you trying to do?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.62,0:10:05.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is one of our...Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.87,0:10:07.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know! Just be quiet.Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.86,0:10:14.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is the only way that I can think of to deal with him.Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.83,0:10:16.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everyone with devil fruit powers has a weakness.Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.92,0:10:18.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll push him out to sea.Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.87,0:10:21.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll go easy, so bear with me!Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.14,0:10:24.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Coup de...Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.81,0:10:27.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vent!Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.57,0:10:40.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You bastard, Franky! That's reckless!Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.84,0:10:43.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What're you doing to our friend?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.86,0:10:47.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. He discussed this with me beforehand.Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.18,0:10:48.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.09,0:11:05.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What're they doing, attacking their own?Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.29,0:11:08.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They sure do make a big fuss.Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.94,0:11:18.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So you're finally free?Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.84,0:11:22.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'd better stop smiling and start regretting.Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.94,0:11:24.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Never again...Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.63,0:11:29.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,will you get a chance to kill me like the one you just had,Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.30,0:11:33.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,World Government!Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.59,0:11:35.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Battleships are preparing their attack!Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.46,0:11:36.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get off of Enies Lobby!Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.84,0:11:38.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're gonna start firing cannons!Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.72,0:11:40.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everyone, get off of the island!Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.26,0:11:42.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll get dragged into the buster call!Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.17,0:11:44.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll die if we stay here!Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.77,0:11:54.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop, Nico Robin!Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.76,0:11:59.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even if you go back the way we came, all you'll find are the corpses of pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.83,0:12:05.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Enough already.Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.12,0:12:09.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Teach her a lesson, Funkfreed!Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.04,0:12:14.42,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy is just ahead.Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.67,0:12:18.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't hit her vital spots, got that?Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.84,0:12:23.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ivory...Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.46,0:12:24.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dart!Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.06,0:12:43.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I won't let you escape, you dumb woman!Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.59,0:12:45.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate me!Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.82,0:12:49.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, let's go through the door to our dreams.Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.84,0:12:57.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's back to normal.Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.05,0:13:04.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He'd better not be dead.Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.22,0:13:08.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect that even his friends wouldn't know how to handle that.Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.14,0:13:11.44,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't you wanna save Nico Robin?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.44,0:13:13.42,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I do!Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.42,0:13:18.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, anyway, the fact remains that he took out a member of CP9.Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.07,0:13:23.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In consideration of your friends who defended you even after you turned...Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.73,0:13:27.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,into such a terrible form, I'll forgive you for attacking me.Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.31,0:13:31.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'd better hurry.Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.28,0:13:38.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But... even if I hurry, I still don't know how to get to the Gates of Justice.Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.26,0:13:42.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll be your guides!Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.90,0:13:45.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Little ones!Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.04,0:13:46.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I found Franky!Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.51,0:13:51.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?! You guys know where the passage to the Gates of Justice is?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.93,0:13:55.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yep, we do! We're here to be guides!Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.39,0:13:59.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Grandma's over there, too.Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.15,0:14:01.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tell me where it is right away!Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.17,0:14:04.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And I'll give you and old hag Kokoro instructions as to what you should do!Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.39,0:14:05.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Roger.Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.84,0:14:12.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's unconscious, but seems to be okay.Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.37,0:14:17.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! I have to bring the keys to Nico Robin as soon as possible!Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.12,0:14:20.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys bring that deer when you come in a bit!Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.67,0:14:24.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Okay. – Got it! Go, Franky!Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.24,0:14:33.31,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,So, we have no choice but to do that to stop Chopper.Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.31,0:14:38.35,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,And then, after that, take these No. 3 and No. 4 keys and hurry to Robin.Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.35,0:14:41.77,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,One of them might unlock her handcuffs.Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.77,0:14:45.70,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,If so, call me using this portable transponder snail that secretary had.Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.70,0:14:47.31,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay.Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.36,0:14:51.99,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Leave freeing Zoro and Noseking to me.Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.99,0:14:54.60,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,That's fine, but what will we do after that?Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.60,0:14:59.48,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,We've come this far, but even if we're able to rescue Nico Robin,Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.48,0:15:03.84,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,there's still no bridge between this tower and Enies Lobby. So we can't go back.Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.84,0:15:05.35,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah.Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.35,0:15:07.35,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Now that a buster call has been sounded,Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.35,0:15:10.47,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,we don't have time to go back the way we came in the first place.Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.47,0:15:11.14,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,So?Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.14,0:15:14.30,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,So there's no question about it, right?Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.23,0:15:19.70,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Behind us is a deadly waterfall. Ahead of us is a mysterious path.Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.70,0:15:20.81,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Which would you pick?Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.81,0:15:22.56,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess that ahead is the only way.Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.56,0:15:26.25,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Then, when we're done with what we have to do here,Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.25,0:15:28.36,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,we'll all gather at the Gates of Justice!Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.36,0:15:30.36,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,As for what's after that, just leave it to...Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.36,0:15:32.02,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,– To you?! – To luck!Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.02,0:15:33.62,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Luck?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.02,0:15:42.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've...Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.03,0:15:43.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wasted quite a bit of time.Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.71,0:15:46.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn straight!Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.12,0:15:50.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you guys have been acting so dumb during an ordeal like this!Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.17,0:15:53.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's because this guy was doing stupid stuff.Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.13,0:15:56.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You both are brainless! Hurry up and get their keys already!Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.31,0:15:57.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tempest Kick:Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.64,0:16:00.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wire!Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.13,0:16:05.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's just as I instructed. Nice job, Zoro-kun!Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.79,0:16:07.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fight! Zoro!Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.26,0:16:09.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys fight, too!Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.36,0:16:14.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That long neck of yours...Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.38,0:16:17.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'd better hope it doesn't become your weak point.Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.45,0:16:19.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No need to worry about that.Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.79,0:16:26.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I gained muscles that are strong enough to give me full control of my neck.Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.50,0:16:27.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And they've got the power of bullets, too!Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.80,0:16:30.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nose Pistol!Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.37,0:16:40.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wh-What the heck?Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.14,0:16:42.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How can we feel this much impact from here?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.74,0:16:57.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,His nose made a square-shaped hole in that rock!Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.87,0:16:59.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That nose is more amazing than Sogepp's!Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.69,0:17:02.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wh-Wh-Who're you calling Sogepp?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.14,0:17:03.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And don't make needless comparisons like that!Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.70,0:17:05.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, at any rate...Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.61,0:17:09.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaku's gotten quite proficient at using his powers.Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.50,0:17:15.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,W-Wolf! I-I'm your adversary!Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.35,0:17:18.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm? Don't get so worked up.Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.05,0:17:21.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys wanna save your friend, right?Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.52,0:17:25.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Th-That's right! I'll take your key!Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.34,0:17:26.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm?Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.41,0:17:29.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.23,0:17:31.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and take it to her.Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.71,0:17:33.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.12,0:17:36.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go save Nico Robin.Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.35,0:17:38.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wh-What on earth are you...Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.03,0:17:45.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To be honest, I don't wanna kill people. I hate blood.Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.21,0:17:46.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm?Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.29,0:17:49.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Th-Then, I'll just...Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.92,0:17:51.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,take the key and...Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.59,0:17:55.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No! Watch out!Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.38,0:17:57.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ten Finger Pistol!Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.39,0:18:04.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't let your guard down.Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.22,0:18:08.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm a wolf. I put people off their guard then go for the throat.Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.12,0:18:22.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp!Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.12,0:18:27.87,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,D-Dammit! What am I doing?Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.14,0:18:32.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What an unbelievable masked idiot!Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.04,0:18:35.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why don't you just run around like you did earlier?Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.33,0:18:37.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're fast as lightning when you're running away.Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.51,0:18:39.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop mocking me.Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.14,0:18:41.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.37,0:18:46.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We no longer have that kind of time.Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.38,0:18:49.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Advanced Kabuto!Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.69,0:18:52.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lethal Sunflower Star!Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.85,0:18:56.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh?Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.02,0:19:07.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see. Fireworks, huh?Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.66,0:19:09.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp!Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.70,0:19:11.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Moon Walk!Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.33,0:19:23.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop it!Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.61,0:19:43.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As I promised, your death will be instantaneous and without pain.Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.36,0:19:47.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Too bad. If you'd stayed connected with that shepherd and had him protect you,Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.04,0:19:48.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you would've been okay.Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.08,0:19:53.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You see what happens when a lamb wanders off all by himself?Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.88,0:19:57.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He gets eaten by a scary wolf.Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.33,0:20:02.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, this is it for you!Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.78,0:20:05.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop it, wolf! You bastard!Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.43,0:20:08.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't kill him! Please! We don't need your key!Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.36,0:20:13.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You fool! You'll die next!Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.33,0:20:17.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tempest Kick!Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.79,0:20:19.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit!Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.86,0:20:22.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, die!Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.24,0:20:30.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp!Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.13,0:20:55.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.90,0:21:07.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The hunter.Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.22,0:21:09.50,Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing:  Galaxy 9000  Timing: Galaxy 9000  Quality Control: Galaxy 9000, ItsKipz, Pepperjack  Soundtracking:  Halee  Graphics:  Datenshi  Karaoke: KaitouYahiko  Translation: Crunchyroll, GaijinDialogue: 0,0:00:00.71,0:00:03.37,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Get running, get runningDialogue: 0,0:00:03.59,0:00:06.46,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,holding our flag high in the skyDialogue: 0,0:00:12.77,0:00:18.06,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Cross this endless sea with me and search for Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.86,0:00:21.81,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,a global miracle no oneDialogue: 0,0:00:21.90,0:00:23.94,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,has yet been able to findDialogue: 0,0:00:24.82,0:00:27.96,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,With our hearts pounding,Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.96,0:00:29.71,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,we'll just charge ahead as we please, following Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.71,0:00:35.59,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,the footprints of those who pursue their dreams Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.42,0:00:39.39,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,No matter how stormy the night,Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.39,0:00:42.39,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,if we put our minds together, Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.39,0:00:46.54,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,we'll get through it Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.68,0:00:47.86,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,alwaysDialogue: 0,0:00:48.76,0:00:51.59,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Get running, get runningDialogue: 0,0:00:51.72,0:00:54.55,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,holding our flag high in the skyDialogue: 0,0:00:54.60,0:00:57.14,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Even though there are tearsDialogue: 0,0:00:57.23,0:01:00.58,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,we don't want anyone to seeDialogue: 0,0:01:00.77,0:01:03.52,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Keep chasing, keep chasing Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.69,0:01:06.52,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,the compass that leads to our dreams Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.61,0:01:09.23,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,always points straight ahead Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.23,0:01:11.40,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,We can't stop hereDialogue: 0,0:01:18.83,0:01:21.49,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Get running, get running,Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.80,0:01:24.54,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,head past everyone elseDialogue: 0,0:01:24.63,0:01:27.12,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,So long as we don't run from it,Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.22,0:01:30.54,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,we can take hold of tomorrow Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.60,0:01:33.63,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Keep chasing, keep chasing Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.68,0:01:36.51,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,everything we see in the moment,Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.56,0:01:38.93,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,we should record it all Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.15,0:01:41.43,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,in the blank slates of our minds Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.52,0:01:41.62,Kanji,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.14,0:00:00.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HDialogue: 2,0:00:00.17,0:00:00.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 2,0:00:00.21,0:00:01.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,sDialogue: 2,0:00:00.24,0:00:01.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,hDialogue: 2,0:00:00.28,0:00:01.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 2,0:00:00.31,0:00:01.57,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,rDialogue: 2,0:00:00.35,0:00:01.57,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 3,0:00:01.57,0:00:02.03,Karaoke,,